OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStill quite
OL,6,Fwindy at first, particularly towards
OL,7,Fthe North Sea coast, but gradually
OL,8,Feasing through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight. Scattered showers from the
OL,10,Fwest in the evening, easing off
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMostly dry bright start. Cloud
OL,14,Fand rain spread north through the
OL,15,Fmorning. Drier for a time in the
OL,16,Fafternoon before more rain in evening.
OL,17,FBecoming windy, gales along Solway
OL,18,FCoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
