OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy on Tuesday with showers, some
OL,7,Fheavy. Winds easing overnight into
OL,8,FWednesday, then bright spells and
OL,9,Fscattered showers. Dry Thursday with
OL,10,Fbright spells and variable cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
